  "instruction": "Open `/home/user/Desktop/coin.brd`, create six prefixed copies of its element set, and save the result as `/home/user/Desktop/coin_panel.brd`.\n\nRequirements:\n1. The file must be valid XML.\n2. The total element count must equal 6 times the original element count in `/home/user/Desktop/coin.brd`.\n3. Every element refdes must start with a cell prefix matching `^[A-Z]\\d+_`.\n4. All six prefixes `A1_`, `A2_`, `A3_`, `B1_`, `B2_`, and `B3_` must appear.\n5. Each prefix must cover the same number of elements as the original board.\n6. All refdes must be unique across the panel.",
